{"4519710": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "BackRoomz: NULL", "steam_appid": 4519710, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [4994770], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4519710/extras/09259152bdb44120140106a21cb70fbf.avif?t=1785185345\" width=1024 height=448 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*Please Note: The game is currently in its Demo phase and I am a solo developer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All of the following can be found in the right sidebar via &quot;Visit the website&quot; OR &quot;View the manual&quot;:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Feedback Survey if you'd like to submit feedback to help out the development process!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Matterdama's Ko-fi if you want to help support the game so I can make a full release!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Press Kit for the press and creators.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4519710/extras/6ab0936df87a1c12f3e215286d3fa1ea.avif?t=1785185345\" width=1024 height=112 /></span>\t</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >BackRoomz: NULL is an atmospheric, parkour and puzzle, sci-fi PC game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You work for RCXV, a mysterious monolith of a company... specifically for their Investigation Sector.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\tThe Investigation Sector's Chief Officer has assigned you the mission to investigate a mysterious anomaly that manifested inside what used to be known as a &quot;perfectly normal&quot; motel!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\tSpecifically, you need to gather a sample from the manifestation to send off to the Research Sector so they can begin specimen tests.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\tNow that you're involved, you must make haste. Stop this *thing* from propagating.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\t&quot;Get in and get out as fast as possible&quot; is what your Chief Investigation Officer said, now stop staring at this block of text and get in there! (Preferably, read on before you do!)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4519710/extras/38261ee4ecadc42f0f5b3459d173d0bc.avif?t=1785185345\" width=338 height=338 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4519710/extras/0339f08f237b582d9efdcc8c34161d1d.avif?t=1785185345\" width=1024 height=112 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\tThis game is *very* atmospheric, and to complement that, there is no UI during gameplay to maximize immersion!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\tTo some extent it is a walking simulator, so look around and appreciate the cosmic beauty of the liminal spaces around you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\tPay sharp attention and interact with the environment around you, clues can be anywhere.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\tThus, headphones are recommended!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4519710/extras/3ce3345862d66b477d46f7139e786e98.avif?t=1785185345\" width=1024 height=312 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4519710/extras/61e0928055045562a964174bab1eafab.avif?t=1785185345\" width=1024 height=112 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\tThe game mechanics advance with progression.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\tAs you play the game, you'll unlock new mechanics for essential gameplay!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\tBy default, you can do parkour *quite well*, but there will be so much more to unlock!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\tThis won't just be a walking simulator, the mechanical experience is designed to improve as you go deeper and deeper!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4519710/extras/092f8d2c732cec059a449185a7d8ebcd.poster.avif?t=1785185345\" width=1024 height=326 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4519710/extras/092f8d2c732cec059a449185a7d8ebcd.webm?t=1785185345\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4519710/extras/092f8d2c732cec059a449185a7d8ebcd.mp4?t=1785185345\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4519710/extras/3b5520d27546355834e24ab3fd8556a4.avif?t=1785185345\" width=1024 height=112 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\tYour truth isn't the only thing to uncover.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\tThe entire Universe has a secret it holds dear.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\tUnlock this forbidden knowledge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\tThe fourth wall will be broken... but so will the fifth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4519710/extras/982b296c44715f948d7ece345cc94517.avif?t=1785185345\" width=1024 height=284 /></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4519710/extras/09259152bdb44120140106a21cb70fbf.avif?t=1785185345\" width=1024 height=448 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*Please Note: The game is currently in its Demo phase and I am a solo developer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All of the following can be found in the right sidebar via &quot;Visit the website&quot; OR &quot;View the manual&quot;:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Feedback Survey if you'd like to submit feedback to help out the development process!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Matterdama's Ko-fi if you want to help support the game so I can make a full release!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Press Kit for the press and creators.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4519710/extras/6ab0936df87a1c12f3e215286d3fa1ea.avif?t=1785185345\" width=1024 height=112 /></span>\t</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >BackRoomz: NULL is an atmospheric, parkour and puzzle, sci-fi PC game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You work for RCXV, a mysterious monolith of a company... specifically for their Investigation Sector.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\tThe Investigation Sector's Chief Officer has assigned you the mission to investigate a mysterious anomaly that manifested inside what used to be known as a &quot;perfectly normal&quot; motel!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\tSpecifically, you need to gather a sample from the manifestation to send off to the Research Sector so they can begin specimen tests.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\tNow that you're involved, you must make haste. Stop this *thing* from propagating.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\t&quot;Get in and get out as fast as possible&quot; is what your Chief Investigation Officer said, now stop staring at this block of text and get in there! (Preferably, read on before you do!)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4519710/extras/38261ee4ecadc42f0f5b3459d173d0bc.avif?t=1785185345\" width=338 height=338 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4519710/extras/0339f08f237b582d9efdcc8c34161d1d.avif?t=1785185345\" width=1024 height=112 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\tThis game is *very* atmospheric, and to complement that, there is no UI during gameplay to maximize immersion!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\tTo some extent it is a walking simulator, so look around and appreciate the cosmic beauty of the liminal spaces around you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\tPay sharp attention and interact with the environment around you, clues can be anywhere.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\tThus, headphones are recommended!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4519710/extras/3ce3345862d66b477d46f7139e786e98.avif?t=1785185345\" width=1024 height=312 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4519710/extras/61e0928055045562a964174bab1eafab.avif?t=1785185345\" width=1024 height=112 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\tThe game mechanics advance with progression.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\tAs you play the game, you'll unlock new mechanics for essential gameplay!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\tBy default, you can do parkour *quite well*, but there will be so much more to unlock!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\tThis won't just be a walking simulator, the mechanical experience is designed to improve as you go deeper and deeper!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4519710/extras/092f8d2c732cec059a449185a7d8ebcd.poster.avif?t=1785185345\" width=1024 height=326 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4519710/extras/092f8d2c732cec059a449185a7d8ebcd.webm?t=1785185345\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4519710/extras/092f8d2c732cec059a449185a7d8ebcd.mp4?t=1785185345\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4519710/extras/3b5520d27546355834e24ab3fd8556a4.avif?t=1785185345\" width=1024 height=112 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\tYour truth isn't the only thing to uncover.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\tThe entire Universe has a secret it holds dear.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\tUnlock this forbidden knowledge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\tThe fourth wall will be broken... but so will the fifth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4519710/extras/982b296c44715f948d7ece345cc94517.avif?t=1785185345\" width=1024 height=284 /></span></p>", "short_description": "Discover NULL: An atmospheric, parkour and puzzle world, where the fourth wall is shredded by an unfathomable force.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4519710/6dc34df66d926f19bcc1d4bffde89ae1fb1c1851/header.jpg?t=1785185345", "capsule_image": "https://shared.a